WEBVTT

00:33:27.229 --> 00:33:30.809
And it's the most amazing thing,
how you can extinguish a fear that way.

00:33:30.833 --> 00:33:35.163
And so, the great irony is, I now have
this crazy career as a public speaker,

00:33:35.187 --> 00:33:38.650
where I'm constantly going in
and speaking to companies

00:33:38.674 --> 00:33:40.788
and organizations and schools,

00:33:40.812 --> 00:33:44.144
and if you had told me that
even one week before giving the TED Talk,

00:33:44.168 --> 00:33:46.486
I would've thought
that was a crazy prediction.

00:33:46.510 --> 00:33:51.343
And now, it's not a big deal.

00:33:51.367 --> 00:33:55.085
And I guess the part that I left out,
it's not only about extinguishing fears

00:33:55.109 --> 00:33:58.901
but it's also, I care so much
about what I'm saying

00:33:58.925 --> 00:34:00.587
and about sharing these ideas,